## Third-party notices

This project incorporates work from the following MIT-licensed projects. Their
copyright and permission notices are retained below as required by the MIT
License.

### conorbronsdon/avoid-ai-writing

The stylometric texture detectors in `skills/anti-slop/scripts/slop-lint.mjs`
(trigram entropy, cross-paragraph burstiness, punctuation-distribution CV,
smart-punctuation signature, bypass normalization) and the catalogue-to-engine
anti-drift contract in `evals/check-catalogue.mjs` are adapted from this
project, with local changes documented inline at the point of use.

