### petergyang/no-ai-slop

The `colon-reveal`, `dramatic-fragment`, and `rhetorical-setup` patterns in
`skills/anti-slop/data/patterns.mjs` are derived from this project's catalogue,
re-scoped locally to reduce false positives (documented inline).

